{"parentUuid":"aed5768f-c107-49e4-a497-c50298b6c0dc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgyjKYEQ8eKdSGBxyiayJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"L2 is committed as 12c3f3e, not pushed.\n\n- **The bar:** `Jobs · Workflows · Workspaces · Harness · Insights · Settings`. The Map joins in L5.\n- **Harness:**\n  - One page with an Everything | Guidance | Checks | Permissions filter, plus All workflows | Workflows.\n  - The app now says Guidance and Check instead of feedforward and feedback, on the sections, the switches and the forms.\n  - On All servers each server gets its own section.\n  - A step's Rules tab now lists Guidance, Checks and Permissions, each with \"Change on Harness\".\n- **Insights:** opens on the Audit Log, with tabs for Costs, Evals and Verification.\n- **Settings:** has a Health tab, which is the old Engine page.\n- **Workflows:** lost its three rules tabs.\n- **Plan:** New request stays its own page.\n- **Checks:** CI and the safeguard pass. I checked the bar, Harness and Insights in the app on `bastion-chart`. \"two\" is back in the switcher.\n\n**Disk is the blocker:** 908Mi is free, and each build round uses 1–2Gi. Free about 5Gi before I continue.\n\n**Next:**\n- **L4, the job page as an interactive trail.** The job's steps become landmarks on a route drawn on the canvas, with send-backs as peaks climbed again, passed commits as checkpoints, and a \"you are here\" marker. Clicking a landmark opens that step in place. The job's `criteria` show first, as the summit.\n- **L5, the Map.** Each server's workflows drawn as routes, with workspaces and harness items placed on them, and click-to-edit."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":274,"cache_read_input_tokens":587841,"output_tokens":565,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":274,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":565,"cache_read_input_tokens":587841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":274,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":274},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b608b04c-dc65-4770-9f53-bcb962818035","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgyjKXjeFe3hWSvs6hjAq","type":"assistant","uuid":"1645b222-0cf5-45eb-8a6e-3d51c7c7f314","timestamp":"2026-11-12T21:18:12.385Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
