{"parentUuid":"c7ec4319-4f0e-4605-b5bc-a895a616bc7f","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_014yofccF9hnNDjy2jJtJiwm","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"5d49675d-549f-451f-992a-9ae4cf1cd3a3","timestamp":"2026-11-12T21:29:58.081Z","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
{"parentUuid":"5d49675d-549f-451f-992a-9ae4cf1cd3a3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgykDRgCpthA4BVGYQYN5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The trail is now drawn as a chart, committed as 29717a2 and not pushed. Earlier, L2 was pushed: `f5fb5c2..12c3f3e`.\n\n**What the job page shows now** (checked on the landed job `j1c15ab9b`, in `bastion-chart`):\n- A ticked double border, faint rhumb lines, and the coast with waves on the left.\n- The outpost: houses with red roofs and a red flag, with base camp tents beside it.\n- Each step as a landmark. An agent's step is a hatched mountain with a snowcap. A shell step is a castle checkpoint. Names are in spaced serif capitals.\n- The walked route in red dashes and the way ahead dotted. A step that's done gets a green pennant, a failed step gets a red X, and the current step gets a red \"you are here\" pin.\n- The summit with a red flag once the job lands. A stopped or failed job ends in the marsh: a reeded pool crossed with an X.\n- A compass rose, plus hills and trees.\n- Hovering a landmark lifts it and shows its state in italics. Pressing it opens that step below.\n- Jobs from before workflows show no landmarks, because they have no step list or workflow to draw from.\n\n**Code:**\n- The drawing pieces live in `pages/carto.rs`, so the Map (L5) reuses them.\n- `.codescene/code-health-rules.json` now exempts `trail.rs` and `map.rs` from the argument-count rule, as it already did for `drawing.rs` and `chart.rs`, because iced's `canvas::Program` fixes those signatures.\n- CI and the safeguard pass.\n\n**The disk is low again: 766Mi free.** Each build round uses about 1–2Gi, so I stopped here. Free about 5Gi and I'll continue with L5: the Map as an interactive chart of each server, with workflows as routes and workspaces and the harness placed on it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":453,"cache_read_input_tokens":675638,"output_tokens":636,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":453,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":636,"cache_read_input_tokens":675638,"cache_creation_input_tokens":453,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":453},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"f41dda49-78d1-4d13-a7e5-9da2db30a763","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgykDRCw8fAYsnJU8i3xh","type":"assistant","uuid":"59edb3df-5d86-4d13-a8c0-2d1a9fe65723","timestamp":"2026-11-12T21:29:58.079Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
